          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:30d1c845a645da658745ec98cd0c27141ac247264636d4ab80bc8c249f3c57e8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fc6ffddff4d84b9d9d39be465470fa8f",
      "statement": "Short-lived element IDs and page-context versions are per-read and therefore per-tab: actions validate against `pageContextId`/`visibleContextId` and fail with `stale_context` or `page_navigated` after navigation or DOM changes, so the agent must re-read the same tab (passing the same `tabId`) after navigation before reusing IDs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/mcp/skills/navigation/SKILL.md#L66-L80",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ffdbbf2e2b070064e9e65b03dd6371c854b31bc5e6520b5ebc3d7c3e0e0b9f4a:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/mcp/skills/using-brijio/SKILL.md#L135-L172",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ae4c3747ba7fd61eae87dc84caff833cd807b8d5252cfa63cc6a7c1a9d1742aa:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b2a0f65dde69492790f96a65cf2ad166",
      "statement": "Tools that accept per-call `tabId` include read_current_page, click_element, fill_input, fill_editable, set_checked, select_options, submit_form, upload_file, perform_batch, navigate_to_url, download_status, download_file, fetch_resource, and capture_screenshot; `list_tabs` and `open_tab` do not take a `tabId` (list_tabs enumerates tabs, open_tab creates one and returns the new id).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/mcp/src/mcp-server.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:21c772698ff263dad4bfdabb0a52096b5a8d749a6010dfe66fd6d0326ab5b758"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f0b82b36df5a470b904fa9228a25f214",
      "statement": "Behavior is covered by focused tests: `packages/shared/src/page-reader.test.ts` verifies tabId-targeted helpers message the given tab and never call `tabs.query` when tabId is set; `packages/shared/src/background-controller.test.ts` covers extractTabId forwarding; Chrome and Safari `background.test.ts` cover tabLister filtering and navigateActiveTabToUrl with/without tabId; and MCP index/protocol tests cover the registered tool surface.",
